{"schemaVersion":1,"systemCode":"DIN:arm-Armn:Latn:32706-2010","dependencies":[],"metadata":{"authority_id":"din","id":"32706-2010","language":"iso-639-2:hye","source_script":"Armn","destination_script":"Latn","name":"DIN 32706:2010-01 Information und Dokumentation - Umschrift des armenischen Alphabets","url":"https://www.din.de","creation_date":"2010","confirmation_date":"2010","description":"Information and documentation -- Romanization of the Armenian alphabet.\n    The norm fixes the rendering of the letters of the Armenian alphabet in letters of the\n    Latin alphabet and is suitable for all fields of application. It follows the principle\n    of transliteration and is based on library practice and on ISO 9985:1996.","notes":["Table 1 renders each letter with its majuscule, minuscule, numeric value (the letters of the Armenian alphabet formerly also served as numerals) and Romanization: a=1, b=2, g=3, d=4, e=5, z=6, ê=7, ẹ=8, t̕=9, ž=10, i=20, l=30, x=40, c=50, k=60, h=70, j=80, ġ=90, č=100, m=200, y=300, n=400, š=500, o=600, č̕=700, p=800, ǰ=900, ṙ=1000, s=2000, v=3000, t=4000, r=5000, c̕=6000, w=7000, p̕=8000, k̕=9000, ô=10000, f=20000.","The ejective consonants are romanized with the combining comma above right (U+0315): t̕ (0074+0315), č̕ (010D+0315), c̕ (0063+0315), p̕ (0070+0315), k̕ (006B+0315).","The letter ǰ is the precomposed U+01F0; its capital cannot currently be represented as a single Unicode character and is post-combined as 004A+030C (footnote a of the source).","The ligature և (U+0587) is romanized ew with the combining double inverted breve (0065+0077+0361). The source notes the alternative representation 0065+FE20+0077+FE21 and that the ligature bow may likewise be set for the Armenian ligatures at U+FB13 to U+FB17; this map does not assign those ligatures Romanizations, as the table does not specify any.","The source document's Unicode annotation column prints the minuscule of letter 18 as 0571; the glyph shown and encoded is ղ U+0572 (0571 is the minuscule of letter 17, ձ).","Normative references: DIN 1460; ISO 9985:1996; ISO/IEC 10646:2003."]},"stages":[{"kind":"stage","name":"main","rules":[{"kind":"parallel","rules":[{"kind":"sub","from":{"kind":"string","value":"Թ"},"to":{"kind":"string","value":"T̕"}},{"kind":"sub","from":{"kind":"string","value":"Չ"},"to":{"kind":"string","value":"Č̕"}},{"kind":"sub","from":{"kind":"string","value":"Ց"},"to":{"kind":"string","value":"C̕"}},{"kind":"sub","from":{"kind":"string","value":"Փ"},"to":{"kind":"string","value":"P̕"}},{"kind":"sub","from":{"kind":"string","value":"Ք"},"to":{"kind":"string","value":"K̕"}},{"kind":"sub","from":{"kind":"string","value":"և"},"to":{"kind":"string","value":"ew͡"}},{"kind":"sub","from":{"kind":"string","value":"Է"},"to":{"kind":"string","value":"Ê"}},{"kind":"sub","from":{"kind":"string","value":"Ը"},"to":{"kind":"string","value":"Ẹ"}},{"kind":"sub","from":{"kind":"string","value":"Ժ"},"to":{"kind":"string","value":"Ž"}},{"kind":"sub","from":{"kind":"string","value":"Ղ"},"to":{"kind":"string","value":"Ġ"}},{"kind":"sub","from":{"kind":"string","value":"Ճ"},"to":{"kind":"string","value":"Č"}},{"kind":"sub","from":{"kind":"string","value":"Շ"},"to":{"kind":"string","value":"Š"}},{"kind":"sub","from":{"kind":"string","value":"Ջ"},"to":{"kind":"string","value":"J̌"}},{"kind":"sub","from":{"kind":"string","value":"Ռ"},"to":{"kind":"string","value":"Ṙ"}},{"kind":"sub","from":{"kind":"string","value":"Օ"},"to":{"kind":"string","value":"Ô"}},{"kind":"sub","from":{"kind":"string","value":"Ա"},"to":{"kind":"string","value":"A"}},{"kind":"sub","from":{"kind":"string","value":"Բ"},"to":{"kind":"string","value":"B"}},{"kind":"sub","from":{"kind":"string","value":"Գ"},"to":{"kind":"string","value":"G"}},{"kind":"sub","from":{"kind":"string","value":"Դ"},"to":{"kind":"string","value":"D"}},{"kind":"sub","from":{"kind":"string","value":"Ե"},"to":{"kind":"string","value":"E"}},{"kind":"sub","from":{"kind":"string","value":"Զ"},"to":{"kind":"st